    "smallPrograms": "benchmarks/tools/bench_type_checker.py. Build-project CLI with repository prelude and --profile. Each pair runs the same source twice in separate compiler processes. Variant order alternates by round; checkUs is wall time around checking the project, including worker completion and diagnostic collection, not thread CPU.",
    "smallProgramQualification": "Each pair must emit identical Wasm or the same required diagnostic code, span and message. Separately instantiated each accepted candidate and checked a value via the guest ABI. Sort inputs were size 100000, two measured iterations and one warmup, using the reference checksum.",
