    "gdev": "Same pinned project for all trials. scripts/integration/time_gdev_parse.ts starts a fresh compiler and times project open to complete, validated Wasm. Files warm in OS cache; host load uncontrolled. Separate profiled runs with one and eight workers. Retained changes run within a live session.",
    "uncertainty": "Medians. Savings are control minus candidate in corresponding pairs. Intervals are descriptive 95% percentile intervals from 10000 resamples of complete paired differences with seed 65361; no correction for multiple workloads."
